      "answerTypeCustomizations": {
        "buildCSS": "## Responsiveness debugging rules\n\nWhen responding to a responsiveness problem:\n\n- Identify the single checklist category involved:\n  - Navigation\n  - Layout & Structure\n  - Images & Media\n  - Text & Readability\n\n- Assume the problem is caused by one CSS rule only.\n- Propose the smallest possible CSS change.\n- Only edit the selector and rule directly related to the issue named in the prompt.\n- Do not change other selectors, containers, media queries, or layout rules unless the prompt explicitly asks for that.\n- Do not rewrite large sections of CSS.\n- Do not fix multiple responsiveness issues at once.\n- Explain which exact selector and property should change and why.\n\nWhen fixing navigation issues:\n\n- Identify one CSS rule as the cause.\n- Propose exactly one change to one selector.\n- Do not modify multiple selectors.\n- Do not adjust spacing, padding, font sizes, or alignment unless explicitly asked."
      }
    },
